WEBVTT

00:00:11.939 --> 00:00:13.941
-[grunts]
-Rock and roll!

00:00:15.116 --> 00:00:16.682
Dude.

00:00:16.726 --> 00:00:17.814
[door creaks]

00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:19.859
BARB:
Not so fast, Popsqueak.

00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:22.688
Hey, boy toy, it's mullet time.

00:00:22.732 --> 00:00:26.040
[strains, growls]

00:00:27.998 --> 00:00:29.173
[grunts]

00:00:29.217 --> 00:00:30.566
[playing rock riff]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:34.962
[grunts]

00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:43.709
♪

00:00:43.753 --> 00:00:46.277
-[gasps]
-[gasps]

00:00:46.321 --> 00:00:49.237
Who wants to party?!

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.760
Without smiling.

00:00:50.803 --> 00:00:53.023
[crowd cheering]

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:54.851
Finish them off.

00:00:56.984 --> 00:00:58.855
-[gasps]
-[rock riff playing]

00:01:13.304 --> 00:01:14.566
What are you doing?

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.352
You're supposed to be
a rock zombie!

00:01:17.395 --> 00:01:19.049
Gumdrops.

00:01:19.093 --> 00:01:20.572
Soundproof and delicious.

00:01:20.616 --> 00:01:22.096
-[gulps]
-[Trolls groaning in disgust]

00:01:22.139 --> 00:01:24.228
[Southern accent]: She learned
that from watching me.

00:01:24.272 --> 00:01:25.534
Give me that!

00:01:25.577 --> 00:01:27.275
I'm not gonna let you
do this to anyone else!

00:01:27.318 --> 00:01:30.626
A world where everyone looks
the same and sounds the same?

00:01:30.669 --> 00:01:32.671
That's not harmony.

00:01:32.715 --> 00:01:34.108
RIFF:
Hey, Barb?

00:01:35.109 --> 00:01:36.066
Hi.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.981
Maybe Queen Poppy has a point.

00:01:38.025 --> 00:01:41.202
If we all look the same,
act the same, dress the same,

00:01:41.245 --> 00:01:44.901
how will anyone know
we're cool or something?

00:01:44.944 --> 00:01:47.164
-[crowd murmuring]
-TROLL: Yeah. He's got a point.

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:48.861
A good point.

00:01:48.905 --> 00:01:52.082
A good queen listens.

00:01:54.302 --> 00:01:57.261
Real harmony
takes lots of voices.

00:01:57.305 --> 00:01:58.306
[grunts]

00:01:58.349 --> 00:02:00.090
Different voices!

00:02:00.134 --> 00:02:02.266
[loud whooshing]

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:05.095
[loud musical rumbling]

00:02:09.273 --> 00:02:10.840
[rumbling stops]

00:02:16.672 --> 00:02:18.543
POPPY [quietly]:
Oh.

00:02:18.587 --> 00:02:19.805
[Branch grunts]

00:02:23.679 --> 00:02:26.203
Branch!

00:02:26.247 --> 00:02:28.162
No.

00:02:28.205 --> 00:02:30.729
[quiet electrical jingling
and whooshing]

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.951
My strings.

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:40.609
[panting]

00:02:40.652 --> 00:02:42.393
What have you done?

00:02:42.437 --> 00:02:45.004
You've destroyed music!

00:02:45.048 --> 00:02:47.181
-[crowd gasping, murmuring]
-Give it up, everybody.

00:02:47.224 --> 00:02:52.447
Thanks to the Queen of Pop,
we've all lost our music.

00:02:54.318 --> 00:02:56.755
History repeats itself.

00:02:56.799 --> 00:03:00.237
Pop has ruined everything.

00:03:15.557 --> 00:03:18.777
[heartbeat thumping faintly]

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:34.141
[heartbeat thumping
rhythmically over speakers]

00:03:39.972 --> 00:03:42.149
-[crowd murmuring quietly]
-[rhythmic heartbeat continues]

00:03:49.417 --> 00:03:51.419
[beatboxing to rhythm]

00:03:57.251 --> 00:03:59.688
Those are my sons.

00:03:59.731 --> 00:04:01.255
Making music.

00:04:01.298 --> 00:04:05.128
[heartbeat and beatboxing
continue]

00:04:08.131 --> 00:04:10.307
[clapping and tapping
to rhythm]

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:15.965
[crowd clapping and stomping
to rhythm, excited chatter]

00:04:26.018 --> 00:04:27.759
-[music stops]
-[heartbeat continues]

00:04:27.803 --> 00:04:31.198
Queen Barb can't take away
something that is inside us.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.289
Because that's where music
really comes from.

00:04:37.029 --> 00:04:40.772
It started with the strings,
but now it comes from us.

00:04:40.816 --> 00:04:42.992
[Trolls vocalizing melodically]

00:04:48.737 --> 00:04:51.827
Yeah, it comes from
our experiences.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.350
Our lives.

00:04:53.394 --> 00:04:54.873
Our culture.

00:04:54.917 --> 00:04:56.397
[melodic vocalizing continues]

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.442
Beautiful. [laughs]

00:04:58.486 --> 00:05:00.052
Listen to that.

00:05:00.096 --> 00:05:02.272
Barb can't take that away.

00:05:02.316 --> 00:05:04.492
[melodic vocalizing continues]

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.950
[vocalizing stops]

00:05:28.733 --> 00:05:32.998
♪ Let me hear you sing

00:05:35.523 --> 00:05:38.656
♪ Sing it together

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.529
♪ Louder than ever

00:05:43.531 --> 00:05:45.446
♪ Forget everything

00:05:45.489 --> 00:05:47.491
POPPY and BRANCH [harmonizing]:
♪ Just sing

00:05:47.535 --> 00:05:50.973
♪ Like it's
what we've been missing ♪

00:05:51.016 --> 00:05:55.717
♪ And they're gonna
listen, listen ♪

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.023
♪ Forget everything

00:05:58.067 --> 00:06:01.853
-♪ Just sing
-[magic chiming]

00:06:01.897 --> 00:06:03.333
Dad?

00:06:03.377 --> 00:06:05.335
-It's all right, Barbara.
-[playing melody]

00:06:05.379 --> 00:06:08.207
Just let everyone be
what they want to be.

00:06:08.251 --> 00:06:10.471
-Including you.
-[growling softly]

00:06:12.255 --> 00:06:13.343
[Trolls humming along]

00:06:13.387 --> 00:06:15.954
♪ You think
you've gotta hide it ♪

00:06:17.913 --> 00:06:20.872
♪ Don't keep it on the shelf

00:06:20.916 --> 00:06:23.353
♪ Let your waist start moving

00:06:23.397 --> 00:06:26.487
♪ Watch the way
I do it, do it ♪

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:31.230
♪ See me do it
like nobody else ♪

00:06:31.274 --> 00:06:33.755
♪ If we sing it all together

00:06:33.798 --> 00:06:35.931
♪ If we sing it all as one

00:06:35.974 --> 00:06:38.194
♪ It's louder than yourself

00:06:38.237 --> 00:06:39.630
♪ All together, everyone

00:06:39.674 --> 00:06:41.676
-♪ Everybody's looking
-♪ Sing it loud now

00:06:41.719 --> 00:06:43.112
♪ Watch the way we do it

00:06:43.155 --> 00:06:44.374
-♪ Hold up, watch out
how I do it ♪ - Do it ♪

00:06:44.418 --> 00:06:47.116
♪ 'Cause we do it
like nobody else ♪

00:06:47.159 --> 00:06:49.118
♪ Let me hear you sing

00:06:49.161 --> 00:06:52.034
♪ Don't you stop it,
don't you fight it ♪

00:06:52.077 --> 00:06:53.949
♪ Let me hear you sing

00:06:53.992 --> 00:06:56.778
♪ If you got it,
can't deny it ♪

00:06:56.821 --> 00:06:58.257
♪ Let me hear you

00:06:58.301 --> 00:07:00.216
♪ It's waiting for you

00:07:00.259 --> 00:07:02.087
♪ Already you know

00:07:02.131 --> 00:07:05.917
♪ That you do it
like nobody else ♪

00:07:05.961 --> 00:07:07.702
♪ Just sing

00:07:07.745 --> 00:07:10.095
-♪ Sing it together
-[whooshing]

00:07:10.139 --> 00:07:13.403
♪ Louder than ever, ever

00:07:13.447 --> 00:07:16.406
♪ Forget everything,
just sing ♪

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.234
♪ Like it's
what we've been missing ♪

00:07:18.277 --> 00:07:20.715
♪ And they're gonna
listen, listen ♪

00:07:20.758 --> 00:07:22.281
Come on, Daddy!

00:07:22.325 --> 00:07:23.805
-Just sing!
-♪ Forget everything

00:07:23.848 --> 00:07:25.241
♪ Let me hear you

00:07:25.284 --> 00:07:27.591
♪ Hey, I've been right here
where you're standing ♪

00:07:27.635 --> 00:07:30.246
♪ I've been standing
on the ground ♪

00:07:30.289 --> 00:07:32.117
♪ And the walls are caving in

00:07:32.161 --> 00:07:33.467
♪ All the walls are fallen

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.207
♪ When my lips start moving

00:07:35.251 --> 00:07:38.385
♪ With the soul I put into it

00:07:38.428 --> 00:07:41.605
♪ And you never heard it
done like this ♪

00:07:41.649 --> 00:07:43.651
-♪ Let me hear you sing
-[yodeling]

00:07:43.694 --> 00:07:45.696
[singing in Korean]

00:07:48.264 --> 00:07:50.440
[singing in Spanish]

